  "description": "Summer/Winter Operating Area: Bahamas\n\nShe elevates luxury to its ultimate expression and makes sailing at sea a truly refined experience. Princess Mila will meet your most exacting desires: with her elegant and innovative design, she offers a state-of-the-art living environment. With her rounded, asymmetrical lines, this luxury power catamaran catches the eye and conveys a sense of intrepid power. Its volumes impress by the ingenuity of their layout as well as by their impressive scale.",
