  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Connor Burns",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819240017::vessel::d5cc25d8-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::1358d9b0-d3d9-11f1-892a-23053bf5325a/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Growing up in Cape Town, South Africa, Captain Connor Burns developed a deep love and respect for the ocean from an early age. That passion naturally led him to a career in yachting, where he has spent the past four years creating memorable luxury charter experiences throughout the Virgin Islands.\nConnor takes pride in making every charter feel personal, relaxed, and effortless. Whether guiding guests to secluded anchorages, favorite snorkeling spots, or the perfect place to enjoy a sunset, he tailors each experience to suit the interests and pace of those on board. Some of his most rewarding moments have been welcoming returning guests year after year and building lasting friendships along the way.\nWhen he is not at the helm, Connor enjoys fishing, diving, surfing, and exploring the outdoors. His genuine enthusiasm for the ocean and island lifestyle is something he loves sharing with every guest aboard PRINCESS MILA."
    },
    {
      "name": "Adamaris Cruz",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819240017::vessel::d5cc25d8-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::23e80c10-d3d9-11f1-892a-23053bf5325a/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Originally from San Juan, Puerto Rico, Chef Adamaris brings a genuine passion for creating memorable dining experiences at sea. For her, cooking is more than a profession — it is a creative outlet and a way to bring people together through fresh ingredients, vibrant flavors, and beautifully presented dishes.\nLife aboard yachts has allowed Adamaris to combine her love of food with travel, adventure, and hospitality. She enjoys designing personalized menus for each charter, embracing new culinary challenges, and making every meal feel like a special part of the guest experience.\nGrowing up in Puerto Rico has strongly influenced her culinary style, inspiring an appreciation for fresh ingredients, bold flavors, and dishes that feel both refined and welcoming. Whether preparing an elegant multi-course dinner, a relaxed lunch on deck, or a beach barbecue, Adamaris puts care and creativity into every plate.\nOutside the galley, she enjoys diving, spending time at the beach, and making memories with family and loved ones. Her goal is always the same: to create food that makes guests feel welcomed, cared for, and excited to gather around the table."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lukas Killian",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::c::7819240017::vessel::d5cc25d8-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::60e6f9f0-d3d9-11f1-ad72-63fb16ec75d2/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Lukas brings a genuine passion for hospitality, professionalism, and exceptional guest service to every charter. With a positive attitude and strong work ethic, he takes pride in anticipating guests’ needs and helping create a relaxed, seamless experience on board.\nKnown for his approachable personality and attention to detail, Lukas quickly makes guests feel welcome and at ease. Whether assisting with water activities, preparing the yacht for the day ahead, or mixing the perfect sunset cocktail, he approaches every task with enthusiasm and a commitment to excellent service.\nLukas especially enjoys being part of the moments that make a charter truly memorable, from helping guests try a new water sport to setting the scene for a relaxing afternoon on deck. His calm, attentive nature allows him to adapt easily to each group and contribute to an atmosphere that feels both polished and genuinely enjoyable.\nAn avid outdoor enthusiast, Lukas enjoys hiking, exploring hidden beaches, snorkeling vibrant reefs, and spending time on the water. His adventurous spirit and love of the ocean make him a natural fit aboard PRINCESS MILA, where he enjoys sharing memorable experiences with guests throughout their charter"
    }
  ],
